sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Web App
    participant Auth0 as Identity Provider
    participant API as Backend Gateway
    participant DB as Postgres Vault

    Client->>Auth0: GET /authorize?client_id=123
    Note over Auth0: Authenticate user & check 2FA token
    Auth0-->>Client: 302 Redirect with Auth Code
    
    loop Token Exchange Handshake
        Client->>Auth0: POST /oauth/token (code + secret)
        Auth0-->>Client: 200 OK (Access Token + Refresh Token)
    end

    alt Valid Token Presentation
        Client->>API: GET /api/v2/secure-resource (Bearer Token)
        API->>DB: Query account details
        DB-->>API: Return encrypted payload
        API-->>Client: 200 OK JSON Data
    else Expired or Invalid Token
        Client->>API: GET /api/v2/secure-resource (Expired Token)
        API-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized (Token Expired)
        Client->>Auth0: POST /oauth/token (grant_type=refresh_token)
        Auth0-->>Client: 200 OK (New Access Token)
    end
